{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/wishlist_now.png?t=1740729706\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make Bad Choices, Create Chaos!</strong><br> <br>Forget building cars and begging for money. Drink, stumble, steal, and smash your way through a world where bad decisions lead to the best stories. Lose control, unlock absurd antics, and turn your neighborhood into your personal playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><strong>What You Can Do:</strong> <br><strong> </strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/1.png?t=1740729706\" />Chug another beer and watch the world bend to your drunken logic. Climb rooftops, \u201cborrow\u201d a lawnmower, or ride a stolen shopping cart straight into trouble. Will you remember it tomorrow? Probably not.  <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/2.png?t=1740729706\" />Lose control of your limbs as you crash into walls, knock over furniture, and send beer bottles flying. See something you like? Snatch it. Raid a house and walk away with an entire barbecue grill\u2014if you can carry it, it's yours! <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/3.png?t=1740729706\" /> Raid their fridge, crash their party, take their TV, or light the barbecue on fire at 3 a.m. See how long you can get away with it before someone calls the cop. <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/4.png?t=1740729706\" /> Throw on ridiculous outfits, pick up bizarre props, and turn yourself into the town\u2019s most fashionable trainwreck. A bathrobe and no shoes? Perfect.  <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/5.png?t=1740729706\" />Sip a beer and casually prank your neighbors, or down moonshine and turn the entire town upside down. Whether you\u2019re a harmless drunk or a full-blown menace is up to you.  <br>  <br> <br><strong>Will You Become a Local Legend?</strong>  <br>Wreak havoc, pull off legendary stunts, break everything in sight, and make sure the NPCs never forget your drunken adventures. No consequences, no regrets\u2014just a whole lot of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/disclaimer.png?t=1740729706\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grab a (virtual) drink, stumble into the unknown, and make a glorious mess in the ultimate sandbox of drunken stupidity!\u00a0<br></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/joindis.png?t=1740729706\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3440390?t=1740729706","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3440390?t=1740729706","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/17ecf5e5d25017360f4813cd9a75c28b8a9f2273/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740729706","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/17ecf5e5d25017360f4813cd9a75c28b8a9f2273/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740729706","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Drunkard Simulator features depictions of alcohol consumption a